<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Address Change Guide</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
        .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .instruction-text { margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .image-container { text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
        .image-container img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
        .step-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
        td { padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
        .footer { margin-top: 50px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #555; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <header style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
            <div>
                <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="height: 60px;">
                <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">UNIVERSITY OF CENTRAL ARKANSAS</h1>
                <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 0;">OFFICE OF THE REGISTRAR</h2>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 12px;">
                <p><span>{{ contact_phone }}</span></p>
                <p><span>{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <h1 style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;">Address Change (myUCA Self Service)</h1>

        <div class="instruction-text">
            <strong>INSTRUCTIONS:</strong> Below are instructions on how to update your address, telephone number, or emergency contacts in myUCA Self Service.
        </div>

        <div class="instruction-text">
            If you are updating your address, as a result of an address hold being placed on your account, please contact the UCA Student Accounts Office at <span>{{ student_accounts_phone }}</span> or <span>{{ student_accounts_email }}</span> to inquire about having that hold removed.
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">1) Log into myUCA using your username and password.</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_login_screen.png" alt="Login Screen">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">2) Locate and click on the Self-Service task.</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_self_service_task.png" alt="Self-Service Task">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">3) Once you are directed to Self - Service, click on Personal Information</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_personal_info.png" alt="Personal Information Screen">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">4) Click on View Addresses and Phones</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_view_addresses.png" alt="View Addresses and Phones Screen">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">5) All available addresses and phone numbers will be shown on this screen. To update, click Update Addresses and Phones</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_update_addresses_button.png" alt="Update Addresses and Phones Button">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">6) Click the Current link beside the address that you would like to update.</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_select_address.png" alt="Select Address Screen">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">7) Update the "Until This Date" to the current date. This tells the system that your current address is no longer valid for the date. Once you have entered the date, click Submit at the bottom of the page.</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_update_date.png" alt="Update Date Screen">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">8) You will now see that the "until" date is present on the old address. Insert a new mailing address, using the drop-down and select button.</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_new_mailing_address.png" alt="New Mailing Address Screen">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">9) Enter the most current date in the "From This Date" field and enter your new address in the fields below. You can also update the primary phone number that should be associated with this address. Once all fields are entered, click the Submit button.</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_enter_new_data.png" alt="Enter New Data Screen">
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">10) Your most current address should now be shown on your screen.</div>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_final_confirmation.png" alt="Final Confirmation Screen">
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>RELEASE: <span>{{ release_version }}</span></p>
            <p>© <span>{{ copyright_year }}</span> Ellucian Company L.P. and its affiliates.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>